{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Woe... Brick be upon ye.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>ABOUT THE GAME</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Down Under Destruction is a chaotic single-player FPS where you play as Dave, a brickie armed with a demonic, throw-able brick, taking revenge on a corrupt Australian construction corporation, OzTron. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With explosive combos, arena combat, and a satirical Aussie setting, it\u2019s tradie mayhem at its finest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089390/extras/1750c519ca67adda9ded170814e5540e.poster.avif?t=1760547765\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089390/extras/1750c519ca67adda9ded170814e5540e.webm?t=1760547765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089390/extras/1750c519ca67adda9ded170814e5540e.mp4?t=1760547765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>FAST-PACED BRICK ACTION</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the OzTron Urban Development Corporation as <strong>Dave</strong>: A Bricklayer vessel to a sentient demonic Brick - <strong>Smoko</strong>, in a brick throwing battle of mundane, yet epic proportions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duke it out in intense brick throwing combat against the armies of OzTron - possessed tradies, OzTron staffers, and hulked out demolition crews.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089390/extras/1ed62b8528df07ddf97f08ff7a40003f.poster.avif?t=1760547765\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089390/extras/1ed62b8528df07ddf97f08ff7a40003f.webm?t=1760547765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089390/extras/1ed62b8528df07ddf97f08ff7a40003f.mp4?t=1760547765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FEATURES</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense, fast-paced combat, with a supernatural brick with special abilities that defy reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A selection of combat arenas in the fictional town of 'Tinnyroo' - based on contemporary Australian locales - to fight through against the forces of OzTron: A quiet  suburban street, a local democratic hardware store, a dilapidated train station, the monolithic OzTron skyscraper, and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089390/extras/b1306efdba047af658c8ac35a2d51e5e.poster.avif?t=1760547765\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089390/extras/b1306efdba047af658c8ac35a2d51e5e.webm?t=1760547765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089390/extras/b1306efdba047af658c8ac35a2d51e5e.mp4?t=1760547765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></spa